contentText:
For years, fans have wondered about the time Hilary Duff showed up to Lindsay Lohan &#8216;s 2003 Freaky Friday premiere amid the two starlets&#8217; rumored feud &#8212; and finally, they&#8217;re getting answers.

While appearing on an episode of Call Her Daddy that dropped Wednesday (Feb. 25), Duff admitted at last that she was &#8220;absolutely&#8221; trying to get a rise out of Lohan by crashing the red carpet more than two decades ago.

&#8220;Yeah, I was a teenager!&#8221; Duff told host Alex Cooper with a laugh.

